<title>MALTA: Slight rise in Malta inflation.</title>
<headline>Slight rise in Malta inflation.</headline>
<dateline>VALLETTA 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Inflation rose by 0.59 of a point, or 0.57 per cent to 2.65 percent in January compared to last December, the Malta Central Office of Statistics said on Monday.</p>
<p>The inflation rate was 3.8 percent in January 1996.</p>
<p>The office said the biggest price increases were in food items.</p>
</text>
